'''Billow Cluster'''{{Ref|m|7|17}} is a niche [[Spells|spell]] that creates a cloud out of any material that is directed into it.

==Description==
Billow cluster contains a central billowing sigil surrounded by collection signs. It collects material directed into it and converts said material into a cloud.

==Usage==
The billow cluster seal was used in the [[Serpent's Bed of Sand|serpent's bed of sand]] seal, where it served to convert the sand generated by the other parts of the spell into a cloud upon which the [[Dragon|dragon]] hunting the [[Qifrey's Atelier|girls]] slept, allowing them the time to destroy the [[Illusory Labyrinth|illusory labyrinth]] seal which was preventing their escape. {{Ref|m|7}}

